公之子，不有二事’，意為韋氏父子均以書法傳家，成就卓然。","en":"A calligrapher of the Wei and Jin periods, son of Supervisor of the Secretariat Wei Dan, and a native of Duling in Jingzhao Commandery, Yong Province. Born of the Jingzhao Wei clan, he inherited his family's learning and excelled in clerical script. Contemporaries praised him, saying, ‘The son of an eminent lord pursues no divergent craft,’ meaning both father and son of the Wei clan upheld calligraphy as their family heritage and attained outstanding achievements.","jp":"魏晋時代の書家。中書監・韋誕の子。雍州京兆郡杜陵の人。京兆韋氏の出身で、父の家学を継ぎ隷書を得意とした。当時の人々から「名公の子、二事有らず」と称えられたが、これは韋氏父子がともに書道を受け継ぎ、卓越した実績を残したことを意味している。","kr":"위진 시대의 서예가이자 중서감 위탄의 아들로, 옹주 경조군 두릉현 출신이다. 경조 위씨 가문 출신으로 부친의 가학을 이어받아 예서에 능했다. 당시 사람들은 '명공의 자제에게 다른 일이 있지 않다(名公之子，不有二事)'라고 칭송하였는데, 이는 위씨 부자가 모두 서예로 가업을 이어 탁월한 성취를 이루었음을 뜻한다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1040215","remark":"","surname":"韦","surnameTc":"韋","surnameEn":"Wei","surnameJp":"韋","surnameKr":"위","surnameOther":"","name":"熊","nameTc":"熊","nameEn":"Xiong","nameJp":"熊","nameKr":"웅","nameOther":"","word":"少季","wordTc":"少季","wordEn":"Shaoji","wordJp":"少季","wordKr":"소계","wordOther":"","icon":"韦熊","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"239","city":"CS1027","gender":"0","rule":"34","force":"46","wise":"70","politics":"69","charm":"71","will":"62","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"11","weaponMaster":"19/22/27/21/25/70/25/20","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4700","battleSoulPoint":"2100","debateSoulPoint":"6200","strategy":"1004208","strategy2":"1005201","professions":"1/0/0/1/1/0/0/3/3/1/0/1/1/0/0/1/3/1/1/3/1/0/2/